      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.Text"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Play any job that uses positionals, land hits from rear and flank, then deliberately miss a few. Compare the Verdict column to where you were actually standing. param2 marked with * matched a 'hit' row in the table. Use Copy export to share the raw values.",
